        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Silk programme on cream silk in black typography with integral fringe at sides.  Produced for 'The Budget of Budgets; or The Union of the Rose, Shamrock and Thistle' and 'The Irishman in Naples' starring Mr Mathews, also with Kia Khan Khruse, Chief of the Indian Jugglers, who will go through his protean transformations, for one night only, The Assembly Rooms, Star and Garter, Richmond, Surrey, 28th May 1817."@en ;
